Act as principal integrations architect, OAuth/security engineer, affiliate-commerce engineer, platform API engineer, backend engineer, QA, SRE.

Use only official APIs/SDKs/OAuth/documented webhooks/approved feeds/approved affiliate & publishing endpoints. No CAPTCHA bypass, browser automation to evade missing APIs, credential scraping, cookie theft, fake engagement, undocumented endpoint abuse, policy evasion.

FIRST ACTION — VERIFY CURRENT PROVIDER CAPABILITIES
Create docs/integrations/provider-capability-matrix.md with Provider, API/Product, capability, supported, access level, scopes, account requirements, review requirements, geographic limits, rate limits, webhooks, sandbox, publishing limits, affiliate limits, restrictions, last verified, source.
Capabilities: AUTH, PROFILE_READ, CATALOG_READ, PRODUCT_READ, OFFER_READ, PROMOTION_READ, AFFILIATE_LINK_CREATE, ORDER_READ, COMMISSION_READ, PAYOUT_READ, IMAGE_PUBLISH, VIDEO_PUBLISH, SHORT_VIDEO_PUBLISH, POST_PUBLISH, CONTENT_STATUS_READ, ANALYTICS_READ, WEBHOOKS.
Never proceed from memory.

PROVIDER ARCHITECTURE
Canonical ProviderAdapter with capabilities, connect, refreshCredential, disconnect, validateAccount, optional catalog/link/publish/status/analytics/webhook methods.
No provider response objects leaking into core.

CAPABILITY REGISTRY
provider, capability, status, reason, required scopes, API version, last_verified_at.
Statuses AVAILABLE, REQUIRES_REVIEW, APPROVAL_REQUIRED, MANUAL, UNSUPPORTED, TEMPORARILY_DISABLED.
Runtime checks capability before action.

NORMALIZED DOMAIN
ProviderAccount, ProviderCredential, ProviderCapability, Merchant, Product, ProductVariant, Offer, Promotion, AffiliateLink, Publication, PublicationStatus, AnalyticsMetric, Conversion, Order, Commission, Refund, Payout, WebhookEvent.

OAUTH
Authorization Code + PKCE when applicable; state, nonce, exact redirects, short-lived state; bind user/org/provider/request/expiration. Prevent CSRF, code interception, account confusion, tenant switching, replay.

CREDENTIAL STORAGE
Encrypted access/refresh tokens with org/provider account, scopes, expiry, key version. Never log/display tokens.

TOKEN REFRESH
Centralized lifecycle with distributed lock. Handle expired/revoked/invalid_grant/scope removed/account disabled/provider unavailable. Revoked → REAUTH_REQUIRED.

ACCOUNT HEALTH
CONNECTED, HEALTHY, EXPIRING, REAUTH_REQUIRED, RATE_LIMITED, DEGRADED, DISABLED, ERROR.
Track last success/error/sync, token expiry, consecutive failures.

HTTP CLIENT
Timeouts, TLS verify, request IDs, retry, rate-limit awareness, response-size limits, normalized errors, redacted logs, metrics.
Failure categories AUTH, RATE_LIMIT, VALIDATION, PERMISSION, NOT_FOUND, TRANSIENT, PROVIDER_OUTAGE, PERMANENT, UNKNOWN.

RETRY / CIRCUIT BREAKER / RATE LIMIT
Retry transient only with exponential backoff+jitter and provider headers. Circuit CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN. Coordinate quotas by provider/app/org/account/endpoint family and priority.

WEBHOOKS
POST /api/v1/webhooks/:provider
Size limit → signature verify → timestamp/replay → persist raw → dedupe → enqueue → quick response → async process.
States RECEIVED, VERIFIED, QUEUED, PROCESSING, PROCESSED, IGNORED, FAILED, DEAD_LETTER.
Idempotent.

CATALOG
Fetch → validate → normalize → dedupe → upsert → ProductUpdated.
Stable canonical product mapping; ambiguous matches require confidence/review.

AFFILIATE LINKS
Provider-neutral AffiliateLinkService. If official creation unavailable, MANUAL. Never construct undocumented affiliate params.

SAFE REDIRECT
/go/:slug; approved verified destination only; block open redirect, javascript/data, malformed URLs, host spoofing, tenant crossing.

PUBLISHING
Normalized PublishInput and normalized result.
Preflight format/codec/dimensions/duration/framerate/bitrate/filesize/audio/caption/title/description/thumbnail restrictions.
States DRAFT, WAITING_APPROVAL, APPROVED, SCHEDULED, QUEUED, UPLOADING, PROCESSING, PUBLISHED, PARTIAL, REJECTED, FAILED, CANCELLED.
Idempotency keys and reconciliation required.

PARTIAL MULTI-PLATFORM
Treat mixed success as PARTIAL; retry failed destinations only.

UPDATE/DELETE CAPABILITIES
Declare CONTENT_CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE individually; never promise unsupported editing/deletion.

ANALYTICS
Normalize impressions, views, engagements, likes, comments, shares, clicks, watch_time, completion_rate, followers, conversions.
Source types PROVIDER_REPORTED, FIRST_PARTY, AFFILIATE_PROVIDER, ESTIMATED.

CONVERSIONS
Ingest click/order/conversion/commission/refund/payout where supported; dedupe by provider IDs.

TIKTOK
Verify current official TikTok/TikTok Shop auth/content/publishing/shop/affiliate/analytics/webhooks/region/review requirements. Implement only verified capabilities.

SHOPEE
Verify Shopee Open Platform and affiliate capabilities by market/account type. No private dashboard scraping. Manual fallback when unavailable.

META
Separate MetaOAuth, FacebookPageAdapter, InstagramProfessionalAdapter, MetaPublishingAdapter, MetaAnalyticsAdapter, MetaWebhookAdapter. Validate ownership, professional account linkage, scopes, review, token lifecycle.

YOUTUBE
GoogleOAuth, YouTubeUploadAdapter, Metadata, Analytics. Support Shorts only through current documented behavior. Track quota.

MOCK MODE
PROVIDER_MODE=mock supporting OAuth, catalog, publish success/failure, rate limit, token expiry, webhook, analytics.
CI never requires live creds.

CONTRACT TESTS
Capability declaration, tenant isolation, normalized auth/rate-limit/transient/permanent errors, idempotent publishing, redacted logs.
Fixtures for 401/403/404/409/422/429/5xx/timeouts/invalid JSON/schema/partial/expired/revoked/missing scope.

VERSIONING
provider_api_version, adapter_version, capability_version. Track provider deprecations and feature flags.

AUDIT + OBSERVABILITY
Audit connect/disconnect/reauthorize/scope/catalog/link/publish/delete/credential rotation/webhook failures/manual retry.
Metrics for requests/errors/latency/rate limits/token refresh/publication/webhooks/catalog sync.

MANUAL FALLBACK
Produce compliant package: video/image, caption, title, description, hashtags, affiliate URL, disclosure, recommended settings. State READY_FOR_MANUAL_PUBLISH.

APPROVAL + COMPLIANCE
Evaluate org policy, provider capability, content risk, product category, AI confidence, disclosure. Decision AUTO_ALLOWED, APPROVAL_REQUIRED, MANUAL_REQUIRED, BLOCKED.
Pre-publish compliance verifies disclosure, claims, restricted category, copyright, trademark, provider metadata, AI disclosure.

SECURITY TESTS
Cross-org OAuth state denied, provider account tenant isolation, encrypted tokens never returned/logged, webhook replay/signature rejected, open redirects rejected, publishing cannot use another tenant account, manual retry preserves ownership.

